    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1e0877-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_003-72a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-07-26T18:29:26.853+09:00">In the Annals the attacker is called kè</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_003-72a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-07-26T18:32:44.013+09:00">and the attackee is called kè. 何休注:伐人者為客，讀伐長言之，齊人語也。見伐者為主，讀伐短言之，齊人語也。"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_001-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2020-07-28T17:34:07.835+09:00">In the case of jí, one desires it (scil. the joining together)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_007-7a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-15T17:04:44.145+09:00">Jìn's Zhào Dùn murdered his lord, Yí Háo.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_007-16a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-15T17:07:55.226+09:00">and upon returning to the state you did not punish the traitor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_009-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-16T16:51:15.281+09:00">In the fourth year, spring, in the third month of the King, on the day jǐyǒu,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_009-94a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-16T18:04:07.474+09:00">the state should have belonged to Jìzǐ [季子].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_010-24a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-17T15:32:56.519+09:00">What is a "sōu" (蒐, military review)?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_010-86a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-17T18:44:11.792+09:00">the Marquis of Jìn, Qùjí, died.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1e0877_CHANT_011-18a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-08-17T20:22:47.503+09:00">11.5.3 Yúyuè entered Wú.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
